# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
vendor/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
package-lock.json.orig

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment Variables & Secrets (CRITICAL FOR GITHUB)
